<<
/Producer (jsPDF 4.2.1)
/Title (RFID Library Automation with Integration to Digital Notice Board)
/Subject (This Service Level Agreement \(SLA\) Brief outlines the terms, performance standards, and obligations governing the provision of an integrated RFID Library Automation System with a Digital Notice Board solution. The agreement spans a period of three \(3\) years from the effective commencement date, ensuring seamless library operations, patron experience enhancement, and real-time information dissemination across the institution.

The system encompasses RFID-based book identification, self-checkout/check-in kiosks, anti-theft security gate, Middleware \(Hitchpilot\), Staff Station, Tags, Cloud CRM,Checkin/Checkout and a cloud based digital notice board for real-time announcements,AI Notices, New Arrivals, Book Synopsis,Best Sellers and event communication.
)
/Author (Fourreck private limited )
/Creator (Fourreck SLA Engine)
/CreationDate (D:20260605171225+05'30')
>>
